Provenance
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The decoders are original implementations written from the ITU-T
Recommendations H.264 (ISO/IEC 14496-10) and H.265 (ISO/IEC 23008-2). They
are not translations of any other decoder's source. The standard tables
(VLC / CABAC context initialisation, scans, filter taps, transform matrices)
are reproduced from the specifications.

Conformance is verified against the ITU-T / JVT and JCT-VC conformance
bitstream suites and against the reference decoders (JM, HM) and libavcodec
as independent oracles; none of their code is included.

Implementations of these standards may be covered by patents. Rights under
